545454}, {"text": "Because I could not stop for Death", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.5493395493395493, "x1": 0.6164835164835165, "y1": 0.5625485625485626}, {"text": "My Life had stood \u2014 a Loaded Gun", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.5656565656565656, "x1": 0.6175824175824176, "y1": 0.5788655788655789}, {"text": "A word dropped careless on a Page", "x0": 0.33186813186813185, "y0": 0.5827505827505828, "x1": 0.6241758241758242, "y1": 0.5959595959595959}, {"text": "+ Drama \u2014 William Shakespeare, Hamlet", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6161616161616161, "x1": 0.5516483516483517, "y1": 0.6293706293706294}, {"text": "+ Film Sofia Coppola, Lost in Translation", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6495726495726496, "x1": 0.5912087912087912, "y1": 0.6627816627816627}], [{"text": "Question 6 \u2014 Elective 5: Intersecting Worlds (25 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.6043956043956044, "y1": 0.0947940947940948}, {"text": "To what extent has your study of ideas and values in Intersecting Worlds enhanced your", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "understanding of the relationship between beauty and necessity?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.1320901320901321, "x1": 0.6406593406593407, "y1": 0.1452991452991453}, {"text": "In your response, refer to TWO of your prescribed texts and at least ONE related text of your", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.1655011655011655, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.17871017871017872}, {"text": "own choosing.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.1825951825951826, "x1": 0.23516483516483516, "y1": 0.19502719502719504}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.23232323232323232, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.24475524475524477}, {"text": "+ Prose Fiction \u2014 Melissa Harrison, Clay", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.4956043956043956, "y1": 0.2789432789432789}, {"text": "\u2014 Alex Miller, Journey to the Stone Country", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.289044289044289, "x1": 0.6527472527472528, "y1": 0.30225330225330227}, {"text": "\u2014 Annie Proulx, The Shipping News", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.3123543123543124, "x1": 0.5846153846153846, "y1": 0.32556332556332557}, {"text": "* Nonfiction \u2014 Tim Winton, Island Home", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3457653457653458, "x1": 0.5230769230769231, "y1": 0.35742035742035744}, {"text": "+ Poetry \u2014 William Wordsworth, William Wordsworth: The Major Works", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3791763791763792, "x1": 0.8153846153846154, "y1": 0.3923853923853924}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.3087912087912088, "y0": 0.40326340326340326, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.4156954156954157}, {"text": "Lines written a few miles above Tintern Abbey", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.4257964257964258, "x1": 0.710989010989011, "y1": 0.439005439005439}, {"text": "*", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.42657342657342656, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.432012432012432}, {"text": "Three years she grew in sun and shower", "x0": 0.33406593406593404, "y0": 0.4428904428904429, "x1": 0.6615384615384615, "y1": 0.4560994560994561}, {"text": "*", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.44366744366744365, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.4491064491064491}, {"text": "My heart leaps up when I behold", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.4592074592074592, "x1": 0.6010989010989011, "y1": 0.47241647241647244}, {"text": "*", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.45998445998445997, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.4654234654234654}, {"text": "Resolution and Independence", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.4755244755244755, "x1": 0.5714285714285714, "y1": 0.4887334887334887}, {"text": "*", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4763014763014763, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.48174048174048173}, {"text": "The world is too much with us", "x0": 0.3340659340659340